      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developed a full-featured art e-commerce platform with role-based access for buyers, sellers, and administrators. The system includes artwork listing and approval workflows, cart-to-checkout order processing, and review, messaging, and notification functionality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;tools&#34;&gt;Tools&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Django, SQLite, Bootstrap, HTML, CSS, JavaScript&lt;/p&gt;
